
===== PARTNER VERDICT (codex, 610s) =====

Implemented S1a.

Changed:
- Added lesson/chapter types and optional `chapters` / `lessons` to `ContentBundle`.
- Added `completedLessonIds` progress persistence, v7 migration, `completedLessonIds` Set exposure, and `markLessonComplete(lesson)`.
- `markLessonComplete` now marks the lesson complete, marks lesson lex/grammar orders known, and resolves real lex entries through `allContent` so existing SRS card seeding uses real item IDs.
- Added `content/ja/lessons.ts` with Chapter 1 and exemplar `ja-lesson-1`.
- Wired `jaChapters` / `jaLessons` into `jaSeedContent`.
- Added focused progress tests.

